rison:p002:m0074","source_anchor":{"start":74,"end":76,"surface":"張泓"},"quote":"帝常疑太子不慧，且朝臣和嶠等多以為言，故欲試之。盡召東宮大小官屬，為設宴會，而密封疑事，使太子決之，停信待反。妃大懼，倩外人作答。答者多引古義。給使張泓曰：「太子不學。而答詔引義，必責作草主，更益譴負。不如直以意對。」妃大喜，語泓：「便為我好答，富貴與汝共之。」泓素有小才，具草，令太子自寫。帝省之，甚悅。先示太子少傅衛瓘，瓘大踧踖，眾人乃知瓘先有毀言，殿上皆稱萬歲。充密遣語妃云：「衛瓘老奴，幾破汝家。」","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-031","source_id":"s-jinshu031-jia-ws2479706-comparison"}],"mentions":[{"start":74,"end":76,"surface":"張泓","id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p002:m0074","kind":"person","person_id":"hl6_xlz_nh0","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison"},{"start":114,"end":115,"surface":"泓","id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p002:m0114","kind":"person","person_id":"hl6_xlz_nh0","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison"},{"start":126,"end":127,"surface":"汝","id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p002:m0126","kind":"person","person_id":"hl6_xlz_nh0","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison"},{"start":131,"end":132,"surface":"泓","id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p002:m0131","kind":"person","person_id":"hl6_xlz_nh0","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005:m0296","start":296,"end":298,"surface":"張泓","kind":"person","person_id":"hl6_xlz_nh0","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：zhanghong。","source_identity_role":"zhanghong","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#zhanghong","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002:m0041","start":179,"end":181,